 string | yes      | The group's name. |","table":"table-2"},"314":{"id":"/docs/api/2026-09-14/access-groups-permissions-add-14","page_id":"/docs/api/2026-09-14/access-groups-permissions-add","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/api/2026-09-14/access-groups-permissions-add#response-200","content":"A permission by its id and title."},"315":{"id":"/docs/api/2026-09-14/access-groups-permissions-add-15","page_id":"/docs/api/2026-09-14/access-groups-permissions-add","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/api/2026-09-14/access-groups-permissions-add#response-200","content":"| Field | Type   | Required | Description          |\n| ----- | ------ | -------- | -------------------- |\n| `id`  | string | yes      | The permission's id. |","table":"table-3"},"316":{"id":"/docs/api/2026-09-14/access-groups-permissions-add-16","page_id":"/docs/api/2026-09-14/access-groups-permissions-add","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/api/2026-09-14/access-groups-permissions-add#response-200","content":"| Field   | Type   | Required | Description                                          |\n| ------- | ------ | -------- | ---------------------------------------------------- |\n| `title` | string | yes      | What the permission lets someone do, in a few words. |","table":"table-3"},"317":{"id":"/docs/api/2026-09-14/access-groups-permissions-add-17","page_id":"/docs/api/2026-09-14/access-groups-permissions-add","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/api/2026-09-14/access-groups-permissions-add#errors","content":"A failed call answers with a problem body: a stable `code` to branch on, a `detail` for people, and `retryable`, which is advice for that one response."},"318":{"id":"/docs/api/2026-09-14/access-groups-permissions-add-18","page_id":"/docs/api/2026-09-14/access-groups-permissions-add","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/api/2026-09-14/access-groups-permissions-add#errors","content":"| Code                       | HTTP status | Meaning                                                       