ryone and privileged takes Everyone off, and the groups and people stay. Manage knowledge sources is required, except that Manage all integrations can change only who gets answers from a synced document. The service checks the fields and document before saving."},"2593":{"id":"/docs/api/2026-09-14/knowledge-documents-update-6","page_id":"/docs/api/2026-09-14/knowledge-documents-update","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/api/2026-09-14/knowledge-documents-update#parameters","content":"| Name       | In   | Type   | Required | Description        |\n| ---------- | ---- | ------ | -------- | ------------------ |\n| `document` | path | string | yes      | The document's id. |","table":"table-0"},"2594":{"id":"/docs/api/2026-09-14/knowledge-documents-update-7","page_id":"/docs/api/2026-09-14/knowledge-documents-update","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/api/2026-09-14/knowledge-documents-update#request-body","content":"| Field      | Type                        | Required | Description                  |\n| ---------- | --------------------------- | -------- | ---------------------------- |\n| `doc_type` | one of `general`, `runbook` |          | A replacement document type. |","table":"table-1"},"2595":{"id":"/docs/api/2026-09-14/knowledge-documents-update-8","page_id":"/docs/api/2026-09-14/knowledge-documents-update","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/api/2026-09-14/knowledge-documents-update#request-body","content":"| Field   | Type   | Required | Description          |\n| ------- | ------ | -------- | -------------------- |\n| `title` | string |          | A replacement title. |","table":"table-1"},"2596":{"id":"/docs/api/2026-09-14/knowledge-documents-update-9","page_id":"/docs/api/2026-09-14/knowledge-documents-update","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/api/2026-09-14/knowledge-documents-update#request-body","content":"| Field        | Type                            | Required | Description                                                                                                                                                           |\n| ------------ | ------------------------------- | -------- | --------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------- |\n| `visibility` | one of `end_user`, `privileged` |          | end_user adds Everyone to who gets answers and privileged takes Everyone off; the groups and people it names stay. Send `who_gets_answers` or `visibility`, not both. |","table":"table-1"},"2597":{"id":"/docs/api/2026-09-14/knowledge-documents-update-10","page_id":"/docs/api/2026-09-14/knowledge-documents-update","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/api/2026-09-14/knowledge-documents-update#request-body","content":"| Field              | Type           | Required | Description                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                |\n| ------------------ | -------------- | -------- | ---------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------- |\n| `who_gets_answers` | list of object |          | Replaces the document's whole list. Who gets answers from the document: groups and people by id, or `anyone` for Everyone. People who can read all privileged documents always get answers too. An empty list leaves only them. A synced document changed here no longer follows its source's settings. Send `who_gets_answers` or `visibility`, not both. |","table":"table-1"},"2598":{"id":"/docs/api/2026-09-14/knowledge-documents-update-11","page_id":"/docs/api/2026-09-14/knowledge-documents-update","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/api/2026-09-14/knowledge-documents-update#request-body","content":"A group, a person, or Everyone, as one entry of who gets answers from a document."},"2599":{"id":"/docs/api/2026-09-14/knowledge-documents-update-12","page_id":"/docs/api/2026-09-14/knowledge-documents-update","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/api/2026-09-14/knowledge-documents-update#request-body","content":"| Field | Type            | Required | Description                                            |\n| ----- | --------------- | -------- | ------------------------------------------------------ |\n| `id`  | string, or null |          | The group's or person's id. Leave it out for `anyone`. |","table":"table-2"},"2600":{"id":"/docs/api/2026-09-14/knowledge-documents-update-13","page_id":"/docs/api/2026-09-14/knowledge-documents-update","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/api/2026-09-14/knowledge-documents-update#request-body","content":"| Field  | Type                               | Required | Description                                                                                                                                                                                     |\n| ------ | ---------------------------------- | -------- | ----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------- |\n| `kind` | one of `group`, `person`, `anyone` | yes      | `group` for a group, `person` for one person, or `anyone` for Everyone, which answers wherever someone asks, Slack, Teams and ticket replies included. The Everyone group is saved as `anyone`. |","table":"table-2"},"2601":{"id":"/docs/api/2026-09-14/knowledge-documents-update-14","page_id":"/docs/api/2026-09-14/knowledge-docu