bulk-update#request-body","content":"| Field      | Type   | Required | Description                                                                     |\n| ---------- | ------ | -------- | ------------------------------------------------------------------------------- |\n| `assignee` | string |          | Hand every ticket to this person: `me` for yourself, or the person's stable id. |","table":"table-0"},"3523":{"id":"/docs/api/2026-09-14/tickets-bulk-update-7","page_id":"/docs/api/2026-09-14/tickets-bulk-update","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/api/2026-09-14/tickets-bulk-update#request-body","content":"| Field      | Type   | Required | Description          |\n| ---------- | ------ | -------- | -------------------- |\n| `priority` | string |          | Change the priority. |","table":"table-0"},"3524":{"id":"/docs/api/2026-09-14/tickets-bulk-update-8","page_id":"/docs/api/2026-09-14/tickets-bulk-update","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/api/2026-09-14/tickets-bulk-update#request-body","content":"| Field   | Type          | Required | Description                      |\n| ------- | ------------- | -------- | -------------------------------- |\n| `queue` | string (uuid) |          | Move every ticket to this queue. |","table":"table-0"},"3525":{"id":"/docs/api/2026-09-14/tickets-bulk-update-9","page_id":"/docs/api/2026-09-14/tickets-bulk-update","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/api/2026-09-14/tickets-bulk-update#request-body","content":"| Field     | Type           | Required | Description                                                              |\n| --------- | -------------- | -------- | ------------------------------------------------------------------------ |\n| `tickets` | list of string | yes      | The tickets to change, by the ids people see in the product. No repeats. |","table":"table-0"},"3526":{"id":"/docs/api/2026-09-14/tickets-bulk-update-10","page_id":"/docs/api/2026-09-14/tickets-bulk-update","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/api/