lowers-add#parameters","content":"| Name     | In   | Type   | Required | Description                                                  |\n| -------- | ---- | ------ | -------- | ------------------------------------------------------------ |\n| `ticket` | path | string | yes      | The ticket id people see in the product, such as `ACME-042`. |","table":"table-0"},"3940":{"id":"/docs/api/2026-09-14/tickets-followers-add-7","page_id":"/docs/api/2026-09-14/tickets-followers-add","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/api/2026-09-14/tickets-followers-add#request-body","content":"Who to add to a ticket's followers."},"3941":{"id":"/docs/api/2026-09-14/tickets-followers-add-8","page_id":"/docs/api/2026-09-14/tickets-followers-add","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/api/2026-09-14/tickets-followers-add#request-body","content":"| Field    | Type           | Required | Description                                                                                                                                                                                                                      |\n| -------- | -------------- | -------- | -------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------- |\n| `emails` | list of string |          | People to add, by their email address. Each must be a member of this organization. Use this when you don't have their id. `people` and `emails` can be sent together, and one request can name at most 100 people counting both. |","table":"table-1"},"3942":{"id":"/docs/api/2026-09-14/tickets-followers-add-9","page_id":"/docs/api/2026-09-14/tickets-followers-add","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/api/2026-09-14/tickets-followers-add#request-body","content":"| Field    | Type                  | Required | Description                                                                                                                                                                                   |\n| -------- | --------------------- | -------- | --------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------- |\n| `people` | list of string (uuid) |          | People to add, by their stable id. Each must be a member of this organization. A person you add can read the ticket. One request can name at most 100 people, counting `people` and `emails`. |","table":"table-1"},"3943":{"id":"/docs/api/2026-09-14/tickets-followers-add-10","page_id":"/docs/api/2026-09-14/tickets-followers-add","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/api/2026-09-14/tickets-followers-add#response-200","content":"| Field      | Type            | Required | Description           |\n| ---------- | --------------- | -------- | --------------------- |\n| `assignee` | object, or null |          | Who is working on it. |","table":"table-2"},"3944":{"id":"/docs/api/2026-09-14/tickets-followers-add-11","page_id":"/docs/api/2026-09-14/tickets-followers-add","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/api/2026-09-14/tickets-followers-add#response-200","content":"| Field               | Type            | Required | Description                             |\n| ------------------- | --------------- | -------- | --------------------------------------- |\n| `available_actions` | object, or null |          | What this caller may do to this ticket. |","table":"table-2"},"3945":{"id":"/docs/api/2026-09-14/tickets-followers-add-12","page_id":"/docs/api/2026-09-14/tickets-followers-add","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/api/2026-09-14/tickets-followers-add#response-200","content":"| Field        | Type               | Required | Description                |\n| ------------ | ------------------ | -------- | -------------------------- |\n| `created_at` | string (date-time) | yes      | When the ticket was filed. |","table":"table-2"},"3946":{"id":"/docs/api/2026-09-14/tickets-followers-add-13","page_id":"/docs/api/2026-09-14/tickets-followers-add","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/api/2026-09-14/tickets-followers-add#response-200","content":"| Field         | Type            | Required | Description                                  |\n| ------------- | --------------- | -------- | -------------------------------------------- |\n| `description` | string, or null |          | The full text of the request, in plain text. |","table":"table-2"},"3947":{"id":"/docs/api/2026-09-14/tickets-followers-add-14","page_id":"/docs/api/2026-09-14/tickets-followers-add","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/api/2026-09-14/tickets-followers-add#response-200","content":"| Field       | Type           | Required | Description                                                                                                                                                                                       |\n| ----------- | -------------- | -------- | ------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------- |\n| `followers` | list of object |          | People who follow this ticket. A follower can read the ticket and hears about its changes. The requester and the assignee always follow it. People who have left the organization are not listed. |","table":"table-2"},"3948":{"id":"/docs/api/2026-09-14/tickets-followers-add-15","page_id":"/docs/api/2026-09-14/tickets-followers-add","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/api/2026-09-14/tickets-followers-add#response-200","content":"| Field  | Type            | Required | Description                                                                                                                        |\n| ------ | --------------- | -------- | ---------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------- |\n| `hold` | object, or null |          | Who has the ticket while it is on hold, when reminders to them start and after how much quiet. Empty unless the ticket is on hold. |","table":"table-2"},"3949":{"id":"/docs/api/2026-09-14/tickets-followers-add-16","page_id":"/docs/api/2026-09-14/tickets-followers-add","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/api/2026-09-14/tickets-followers-add#response-200","content":"| Field | Type   | Required | Description                              |\n| ----- | ------ | -------- | ---------------------------------------- |\n| `id`  | string | yes      | The ticket id people see in the product. |","table":"table-2"},"3950":{"id":"/docs/api/2026-09-14/tickets-followers-add-17","page_id":"/docs/api/2026-09-14/tickets-followers-add","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/api/2026-09-14/tickets-followers-add#response-200","content":"| Field      | Type            | Required | Description                     |\n| ---------- | --------------- | -------- | ------------------------------- |\n| `priority` | string, or null |          | Slug of this ticket's priority. |","table":"table-2"},"3951":{"id":"/docs/api/2026-09-14/tickets-followers-add-18","page_id":"/docs/api/2026-09-14/tickets-followers-add","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/api/2026-09-14/tickets-followers-add#response-200","content":"| Field   | Type                   | Required | Description                                  |\n| ------- | ---------------------- | -------- | -------------------------------------------- |\n| `queue` | string (uuid), or null |          | Identifier of the queue this ticket sits in. |","table":"table-2"},"3952":{"id":"/docs/api/2026-09-14/tickets-followers-add-19","page_id":"/docs/api/2026-09-14/tickets-followers-add","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/api/2026-09-14/tickets-followers-add#response-200","content":"| Field       | Type            | Required | Description 