pi/2026-09-14/tickets-transition","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/api/2026-09-14/tickets-transition#response-200","content":"| Field | Type   | Required | Description                              |\n| ----- | ------ | -------- | ---------------------------------------- |\n| `id`  | string | yes      | The ticket id people see in the product. |","table":"table-4"},"4463":{"id":"/docs/api/2026-09-14/tickets-transition-24","page_id":"/docs/api/2026-09-14/tickets-transition","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/api/2026-09-14/tickets-transition#response-200","content":"| Field      | Type            | Required | Description                     |\n| ---------- | --------------- | -------- | ------------------------------- |\n| `priority` | string, or null |          | Slug of this ticket's priority. |","table":"table-4"},"4464":{"id":"/docs/api/2026-09-14/tickets-transition-25","page_id":"/docs/api/2026-09-14/tickets-transition","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/api/2026-09-14/tickets-transition#response-200","content":"| Field   | Type                   | Required | Description                                  |\n| ------- | ---------------------- | -------- | -------------------------------------------- |\n| `queue` | string (uuid), or null |          | Identifier of the queue this ticket sits in. |","table":"table-4"},"4465":{"id":"/docs/api/2026-09-14/tickets-transition-26","page_id":"/docs/api/2026-09-14/tickets-transition","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/api/2026-09-14/tickets-transition#response-200","content":"| Field       | Type            | Required | Description            |\n| ----------- | --------------- | -------- | ---------------------- |\n| `requester` | object, or null |          | Who the ticket is for. |","table":"table-4"},"4466":{"id":"/docs/api/2026-09-14/tickets-transition-27","page_id":"/docs/api/2026-09-14/tickets-transition","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/api/2026-09-14/tickets-transition#response-200","content":"| Field     | Type                        | Required | Description                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                  |\n| --------- | --------------------------- | -------- | ------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------ |\n| `routing` | one of `pending`, `settled` | yes      | Fixed values: `settled` once the ticket has a stored queue and a stored `state`, `pending` until then, while automatic routing may still change the queue, state or priority. A ticket just filed can show `state: open` while `routing` is still `pending`. |","table":"table-4"},"4467":{"id":"/docs/api/2026-09-14/tickets-transition-28","page_id":"/docs/api/2026-09-14/tickets-transition","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/api/2026-09-14/tickets-transition#response-200","content":"| Field           | Type   | Required | Description                                                             |\n| --------------- | ------ | -------- | ----------------------------------------------------------------------- |\n| `service_level` | object | yes      | When a reply and a resolution are due, as the ticket's queue sets them. |","table":"table-4"},"4468":{"id":"/docs/api/2026-09-14/tickets-transition-29","page_id":"/docs/api/2026-09-14/tickets-transition","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/api/2026-09-14/tickets-transition#response-200","content":"| Field   | Type            | Required | Description                                                                                                                                                                                                                                      