      | The person the ticket was handed to while it is on hold. They are the one reminded. Empty when no one was named, or when the person has left the organization. |","table":"table-8"},"4484":{"id":"/docs/api/2026-09-14/tickets-transition-45","page_id":"/docs/api/2026-09-14/tickets-transition","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/api/2026-09-14/tickets-transition#response-200","content":"| Field            | Type             | Required | Description                                                                                                                                                                                                        |\n| ---------------- | ---------------- | -------- | ------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------ |\n| `reminder_hours` | integer, or null | yes      | How many hours the ticket can go without activity before the delegate is reminded. New activity starts the count again. Empty when this ticket has no setting of its own, which means the queue's setting applies. |","table":"table-8"},"4485":{"id":"/docs/api/2026-09-14/tickets-transition-46","page_id":"/docs/api/2026-09-14/tickets-transition","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/api/2026-09-14/tickets-transition#response-200","content":"| Field   | Type                        | Required | Description                                                                                                                                         |\n| ------- | --------------------------- | -------- | --------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------- |\n| `until` | string (date-time), or null | yes      | Reminders to the delegate wait until this time. The ticket stays on hold after it, until someone moves it on. Empty when reminders are not delayed. |","table":"table-8"},"4486":{"id":"/docs/api/2026-09-14/tickets-transition-47","page_id":"/docs/api/2026-09-14/tickets-transition","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/api/2026-09-14/tickets-transition#response-200","content":"A person, as they appear in a response."},"4487":{"id":"/docs/api/2026-09-14/tickets-transition-48","page_id":"/docs/api/2026-09-14/tickets-transition","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/api/2026-09-14/tickets-transition#response-200","content":"| Field          | Type   | Required | Description                                     |\n| -------------- | ------ | -------- | ----------------------------------------------- |\n| `display_name` | string | yes      | How this person's name is shown in the product. |","table":"table-9"},"4488":{"id":"/docs/api/2026-09-14/tickets-transition-49","page_id":"/docs/api/2026-09-14/tickets-transition","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/api/2026-09-14/tickets-transition#response-200","content":"| Field | Type   | Required | Description                                                                                                      |\n| ----- | ------ | -------- | ---------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------- |\n| `id`  | string | yes      | This person's stable id. Pass it as `assignee`, `delegate`, in `followers` or as a people path to refer to them. |","table":"table-9"},"4489":{"id":"/docs/api/2026-09-14/tickets-transition-50","page_id":"/docs/api/2026-09-14/tickets-transition","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/api/2026-09-14/tickets-transition#response-200","content":"The ticket's service level clock: when a reply and a resolution are due."},"4490":{"id":"/docs/api/2026-09-14/tickets-transition-51","page_id":"/docs/api/2026-09-14/tickets-transition","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/api/2026-09-14/tickets-transition#response-200","content":"| Field          | Type    | Required | Description          