---------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------- |\n| `open_to_everyone` | boolean | yes      | Whether it is offered for people to start themselves and is ready for that. Being offered does not mean you can start it, and people with wider access to workflows can start workflows this says `false` for. |","table":"table-2"},"4674":{"id":"/docs/api/2026-09-14/workflows-availability-set-15","page_id":"/docs/api/2026-09-14/workflows-availability-set","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/api/2026-09-14/workflows-availability-set#response-200","content":"| Field               | Type             | Required | Description                                                                                                                                     |\n| ------------------- | ---------------- | -------- | ----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------- |\n| `published_version` | integer, or null | yes      | The version a run starts on by default. `null` until the first version is published, so `null` means the workflow has no published version yet. |","table":"table-2"},"4675":{"id":"/docs/api/2026-09-14/workflows-availability-set-16","page_id":"/docs/api/2026-09-14/workflows-availability-set","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/api/2026-09-14/workflows-availability-set#response-200","content":"One thing a person fills in to start a workflow."},"4676":{"id":"/docs/api/2026-09-14/workflows-availability-set-17","page_id":"/docs/api/2026-09-14/workflows-availability-set","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/api/2026-09-14/workflows-availability-set#response-200","content":"| Field         | Type   | Required | Description                                         |\n| ------------- | ------ | -------- | ---------------------------------------------