 Meaning                                                                                      |\n| -------------- | ----------- | -------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------- |\n| `RATE_LIMITED` | 429         | You are sending requests too quickly. Wait as long as the response says, then send it again. |","table":"table-2"},"4721":{"id":"/docs/api/2026-09-14/workflows-delete-19","page_id":"/docs/api/2026-09-14/workflows-delete","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/api/2026-09-14/workflows-delete#errors","content":"| Code            | HTTP status | Meaning                                                                                |\n| --------------- | ----------- | -------------------------------------------------------------------------------------- |\n| `SCOPE_MISSING` | 403         | Your connection was not granted access to this kind of action. Reconnect and grant it. |","table":"table-2"},"4722":{"id":"/docs/api/2026-09-14/workflows-delete-20","page_id":"/docs/api/2026-09-14/workflows-delete","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/api/2026-09-14/workflows-delete#errors","content":"| Code              | HTTP status | Meaning                                                          |\n| ----------------- | ----------- | ---------------------------------------------------------------- |\n| `UNAUTHENTICATED` | 401         | You are not signed in, or your token has expired. Sign in again. |","table":"table-2"},"4723":{"id":"/docs/api/2026-09-14/workflows-delete-21","page_id":"/docs/api/2026-09-14/workflows-delete","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/api/2026-09-14/workflows-delete#errors","content":"| Code          | HTTP status | Meaning                                                  |\n| ------------- | ----------- | -------------------------------------------------------- |\n| `UNAVAILABLE` | 503         | The service is temporarily unavailable. Try again later. |","table":"table-2"},"4724":{"id":"/docs/api/2026-09-14/workflows-delete-22","page_id":"/docs/api/2026-09-14/workflows-delete","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/api/2026-09-14/workflows-delete#errors","content":"| Code                | HTTP status | Meaning                                                                              |\n| ------------------- | ----------- | ------------------------------------------------------------------------------------ |\n| `VALIDATION_FAILED` | 422         | Part of the request is not valid. Correct what the response names and send it again. |","table":"table-2"},"4725":{"id":"/docs/api/2026-09-14/workflows-delete-23","page_id":"/docs/api/2026-09-14/workflows-delete","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/api/2026-09-14/workflows-delete#errors","content":"| Code              | HTTP status | Meaning                                                                                         |\n| ----------------- | ----------- | ----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------- |\n| `VERSION_UNKNOWN` | 400         | This API does not serve the version you asked for. Send one of the dates in published_versions. |","table":"table-2"},"4726":{"id":"/docs/api/2026-09-14/workflows-dependencies-list","page_id":"/docs/api/2026-09-14/workflows-dependencies-list","type":"page","content":"List what a workflow calls and what calls it","breadcrumbs":["Docs","API reference","2026-09-14","Workflows"],"tags":[],"url":"/docs/api/2026-09-14/workflows-dependencies-list"},"4727":{"id":"/docs/api/2026-09-14/workflows-dependencies-list-0","page_id":"/docs/api/2026-09-14/workflows-dependencies-list","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/api/2026-09-14/workflows-dependencies-list","content":"GET /workflows/{workflow}/dependencies"},"4728":{"id":"/docs/api/2026-09-14/workflows-dependencies-list-1","page_id":"/docs/api/2026-09-14/workflows-dependencies-list","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/api/2026-09-14/workflows-dependencies-list#parameters","content":"Parameters"},"4729":{"id":"/docs/api/2026-09-14/workflows-dependencies-list-2","page_id":"/docs/api/2026-09-14/workflows-dependencies-list","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/api/2026-09-14/workflows-dependencies-list#response-200","content":"Response 200"},"4730":{"id":"/docs/api/2026-09-14/workflows-dependencies-list-3","page_id":"/docs/api/2026-09-14/workflows-dependencies-list","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/api/2026-09-14/workflows-dependencies-list#errors","content":"Errors"},"4731":{"id":"/docs/api/2026-09-14/workflows-dependencies-list-4","page_id":"/docs/api/2026-09-14/workflows-dependencies-list","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/api/2026-09-14/workflows-dependencies-list","content":"The workflows a version calls, and the workflows that call this one from their published versions. Read it before deleting or turning off a workflow: those callers are turned off with it. Only workflows you can see are listed, so some callers may be missing, and the flags do not account for them. Deleted workflows are not listed in what a version calls. `calls_complete` and `callers_complete` say when what you can see may be short. The first 100 calls to the workflow are read, with no next page."},"4732":{"id":"/docs/api/2026-09-14/workflows-dependencies-list-5","page_id":"/docs/api/2026-09-14/workflows-dependencies-list","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/api/2026-09-14/workflows-dependencies-list#parameters","content":"| Name       | In   | Type   | Required | Description                                    |\n| ---------- | ---- | ------ | -------- | ---------------------------------------------- |\n| `workflow` | path | string | yes      | The workflow's id, from the list of workflows. |","table":"table-0"},"4733":{"id":"/docs/api/2026-09-14/workflows-dependencies-list-6","page_id":"/docs/api/2026-09-14/workflows-dependencies-list","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/api/2026-09-14/workflows-dependencies-list#parameters","content":"| Name      | In    | Type   | Required | Description                                                  |\n| --------- | ----- | ------ | -------- | ------------------------------------------------------------ |\n| `version` | query | string |          | The version to read. Leave it out for the published version. |","table":"table-0"},"4734":{"id":"/docs/api/2026-09-14/workflows-dependencies-list-7","page_id":"/docs/api/2026-09-14/workflows-dependencies-list","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/api/2026-09-14/workflows-dependencies-list#response-200","content":"| Field       | Type           | Required | Description                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                       |\n| ----------- | -------------- | -------- | ------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------- |\n| `called_by` | list of object | yes      | Workflows that call this one, from their published versions, once for each version of this workflow they ask for. The first 100 calls to this workflow are read, and a workflow that calls it from two steps counts twice, so fewer callers may be listed. Only workflows you can see are listed. |","table":"table-1"},"4735":{"id":"/docs/api/2026-09-14/workflows-dependencies-list-8","page_id":"/docs/api/2026-09-14/workflows-dependencies-list","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/api/2026-09-14/workflows-dependencies-list#response-200","content":"| Field              | Type    | Required | Description                                                                                                                                                                                                             |\n| ------------------ | ------- | -------- | ----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------- |\n| `callers_complete` | boolean | yes      | `false` when more callers you can see exist than are listed, or when some workflow's calls could not be read. A caller you cannot see is never listed, whatever this says, and deleting the workflow also turns it off. |","table":"table-1"},"4736":{"id":"/docs/api/2026-09-14/workflows-dependencies-list-9","page_id":"/docs/api/2026-09-14/workflows-dependencies-list","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/api/2026-09-14/workflows-dependencies-list#response-200","content":"| Field   | Type           | Required | Description                                                                                                                                                                            |\n| ------- | -------------- | -------- | -------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------- |\n| `calls` | list of object | yes      | The workflows this version calls, once for each version of a workflow it asks for. A workflow that was deleted, or that you cannot see, is not listed, whatever `calls_complete` says. |","table":"table-1"},"4737":{"id":"/docs/api/2026-09-14/workflows-dependencies-list-10","page_id":"/docs/api/2026-09-14/workflows-dependencies-list","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/api/2026-09-14/workflows-dependencies-list#response-200","content":"| Field            | Type    | Required | Description                                                                                                                                                   |\n| ---------------- | ------- | -------- | ------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------- |\n| `calls_complete` | boolean | yes      | `false` when some calls could not be worked out from the workflow, or name a version that is only chosen while it runs, so `calls` may be short or imprecise. |","table":"table-1"},"4738":{"id":"/docs/api/2026-09-14/workflows-dependencies-list-11","page_id":"/docs/api/2026-09-14/workflows-dependencies-list","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/api/2026-09-14/workflows-dependencies-list#response-200","content":"| Field | Type   | Required | Description        |\n| ----- | ------ | -------- | ------------------ |\n| `id`  | string | yes      | The workflow's id. |","table":"table-1"},"4739":{"id":"/docs/api/2026-09-14/workflows-dependencies-list-12","page_id":"/docs/api/2026-09-14/workflows-dependencies-list","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/api/2026-09-14/workflows-dependencies-list#response-200","content":"| Field     | Type    | Required | Description                        |\n| --------- | ------- | -------- | ---------------------------------- |\n| `version` | integer | yes      | The version whose calls are shown. |","table":"table-1"},"4740":{"id":"/docs/api/2026-09-14/workflows-dependencies-list-13","page_id":"/docs/api/2026-09-14/workflows-dependencies-list","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/api/2026-09-14/workflows-dependencies-list#response-200","content":"One workflow calling another."},"4741":{"id":"/docs/api/2026-09-14/workflows-dependencies-list-14","page_id":"/docs/api/2026-09-14/workflows-dependencies-list","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/api/2026-09-14/workflows-dependencies-list#response-200","content":"| Field            | Type    | Required | Description                                          |\n| ---------------- | ------- | -------- | ---------------------------------------------------- |\n| `caller_version