14/workflows-grants-list","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/api/2026-09-14/workflows-grants-list#parameters","content":"| Name       | In   | Type   | Required | Description                                    |\n| ---------- | ---- | ------ | -------- | ---------------------------------------------- |\n| `workflow` | path | string | yes      | The workflow's id, from the list of workflows. |","table":"table-0"},"4943":{"id":"/docs/api/2026-09-14/workflows-grants-list-6","page_id":"/docs/api/2026-09-14/workflows-grants-list","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/api/2026-09-14/workflows-grants-list#response-200","content":"| Field    | Type           | Required | Description                                                         |\n| -------- | -------------- | -------- | ------------------------------------------------------------------- |\n| `grants` | list of object | yes      | Access given on this workflow alone. A grant can be one of several. |","table":"table-1"},"4944":{"id":"/docs/api/2026-09-14/workflows-grants-list-7","page_id":"/docs/api/2026-09-14/workflows-grants-list","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/api/2026-09-14/workflows-grants-list#response-200","content":"| Field       | Type           | Required | Description                                                                                                        |\n| ----------- | -------------- | -------- | ------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------ |\n| `inherited` | list of object | yes      | Access that covers every workflow in your organization and so reaches this one. It cannot be taken away from here. |","table":"table-1"},"4945":{"id":"/docs/api/2026-09-14/workflows-grants-list-8","page_id":"/docs/api/2026-09-14/workflows-grants-list","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/api/2026-09-14/workflows-grants-list#response-200","content":"One thing a person or group can do with a workflow."},"4946":{"id":"/docs/api/2026-09-14/workflows-grants-list-9","page_id":"/docs/api/2026-09-14/workflows-grants-list","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/api/2026-09-14/workflows-grants-list#response-200","content":"| Field      | Type                                                                         | Required | Description                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                          |\n| ---------- | ---------------------------------------------------------------------------- | -------- | ------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------ |\n| `given_by` | list of one of `workflow_access`, `admin`, `availability`, `other` or string | yes      | Who put this access there, one name for each who did: `workflow_access` (the workflows product itself: the access settings in the web app or this API), `availability` (everyone's right to start a workflow that is offered to everyone), `admin` (an administrator, from the access settings of your organization) or `other`. Only access that is just `workflow_access` can be taken away here. Empty for access that covers every workflow, which is not listed by who gave it. |","table":"table-2"},"4947":{"id":"/docs/api/2026-09-14/workflows-grants-list-10","