:"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/api/2026-09-14/workflows-grants-remove#parameters","content":"Parameters"},"4969":{"id":"/docs/api/2026-09-14/workflows-grants-remove-2","page_id":"/docs/api/2026-09-14/workflows-grants-remove","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/api/2026-09-14/workflows-grants-remove#response-200","content":"Response 200"},"4970":{"id":"/docs/api/2026-09-14/workflows-grants-remove-3","page_id":"/docs/api/2026-09-14/workflows-grants-remove","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/api/2026-09-14/workflows-grants-remove#errors","content":"Errors"},"4971":{"id":"/docs/api/2026-09-14/workflows-grants-remove-4","page_id":"/docs/api/2026-09-14/workflows-grants-remove","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/api/2026-09-14/workflows-grants-remove","content":"Take away one kind of access to this workflow. It changes what they can do with it straight away. Taking away access someone does not have changes nothing. Access that was given somewhere else, or that everyone has because the workflow is offered to everyone, is not taken away here: you are told, and nothing changes. The list of access says who gave each one. If someone else also gave the access, `held` stays `true` after you take away yours. Access that covers every workflow in your organization is not touched by this. Anyone who can change who has access to a workflow can take away their own, and taking away your own publish access can leave you unable to change it again. For people who manage this workflow's access."},"4972":{"id":"/docs/api/2026-09-14/workflows-grants-remove-5","page_id":"/docs/api/2026-09-14/workflows-grants-remove","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/api/2026-09-14/workflows-grants-remove#parameters","content":"| Name       | In   | Type   | Required | Description                                    |\n| ---------- | ---- | ------ | -------- | ---------------------------------------------- |\n| `workflow` | path | string | yes      | The workflow's id, from the list of workflows. |","table":"table-0"},"4973":{"id":"/docs/api/2026-09-14/workflows-grants-remove-6","page_id":"/docs/api/2026-09-14/workflows-grants-remove","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/api/2026-09-14/workflows-grants-remove#parameters","content":"| Name           | In   | Type   | Required | Description                                                               |\n| -------------- | ---- | ------ | -------- | ------------------------------------------------------------------------- |\n| `grantee_type` | path | string | yes      | `person` or `group`. Everyone in your organization is the group Everyone. |","table":"table-0"},"4974":{"id":"/docs/api/2026-09-14/workflows-grants-remove-7","page_id":"/docs/api/2026-09-14/workflows-grants-remove","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/api/2026-09-14/workflows-grants-remove#parameters","content":"| Name      | In   | Type   | Required | Description                                                 |\n| --------- | ---- | ------ | -------- | ----------------------------------------------------------- |\n| `grantee` | path | string | yes      | The person's id, or the group's id from the list of groups. |","table":"table-0"},"4975":{"id":"/docs/api/2026-09-14/workflows-grants-remove-8","page_id":"/docs/api/2026-09-14/workflows-grants-remove","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/api/2026-09-14/workflows-grants-remove#parameters","content":"| Name         | In   | Type   | Required | Description                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                           |\n| ------------ | ---- | ------ | -------- | ------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------