parameters","content":"Parameters"},"5167":{"id":"/docs/api/2026-09-14/workflows-runs-get-2","page_id":"/docs/api/2026-09-14/workflows-runs-get","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/api/2026-09-14/workflows-runs-get#response-200","content":"Response 200"},"5168":{"id":"/docs/api/2026-09-14/workflows-runs-get-3","page_id":"/docs/api/2026-09-14/workflows-runs-get","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/api/2026-09-14/workflows-runs-get#errors","content":"Errors"},"5169":{"id":"/docs/api/2026-09-14/workflows-runs-get-4","page_id":"/docs/api/2026-09-14/workflows-runs-get","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/api/2026-09-14/workflows-runs-get","content":"A run of a workflow: whether it is running, waiting on a person or finished, how it ended, what went wrong if it failed, the step it is on, its ticket, and the approvals, tasks and forms it is waiting on now. A run you cannot see, and a run of a single action, is reported as not found. A dry run, which simulates the actions that reach outside the workflow, says so in `dry_run`. The values the run was started with and the values it produced are not shown."},"5170":{"id":"/docs/api/2026-09-14/workflows-runs-get-5","page_id":"/docs/api/2026-09-14/workflows-runs-get","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/api/2026-09-14/workflows-runs-get#parameters","content":"| Name  | In   | Type   | Required | Description   |\n| ----- | ---- | ------ | -------- | ------------- |\n| `run` | path | string | yes      | The run's id. |","table":"table-0"},"5171":{"id":"/docs/api/2026-09-14/workflows-runs-get-6","page_id":"/docs/api/2026-09-14/workflows-runs-get","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/api/2026-09-14/workflows-runs-get#response-200","content":"| Field     | Type    | Required | Description                                                                                                              |\n| --------- | ------- | -------- | ------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------ |\n| `dry_run` | boolean | yes      | `true` for a dry run. A dry run simulates the actions that reach outside the workflow, so nothing there really happened. |","table":"table-1"},"5172":{"id":"/docs/api/2026-09-14/workflows-runs-get-7","page_id":"/docs/api/2026-09-14/workflows-runs-get","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/api/2026-09-14/workflows-runs-get#response-200","content":"| Field  | Type            | Required | Description                                       |\n| ------ | --------------- | -------- | ------------------------------------------------- |\n| `exit` | object, or null | yes      | What the workflow reported. `null` until it does. |","table":"table-1"},"5173":{"id":"/docs/api/2026-09-14/workflows-runs-get-8","page_id":"/docs/api/2026-09-14/workflows-runs-get","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/api/2026-09-14/workflows-runs-get#response-200","content":"| Field     | Type            | Required | Description                                                                            |\n| --------- | --------------- | -------- | -------------------------------------------------------------------------------------- |\n| `failure` | object, or null | yes      | What is known about a failure. `null` when there is none, as for a run that succeeded. |","table":"table-1"},"5174":{"id":"/docs/api/2026-09-14/workflows-runs-get-9","page_id":"/docs/api/2026-09-14/workflows-runs-get","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/api/2026-09-14/workflows-runs-get#response-200","content":"| Field | Type   | Required | Description   |\n| ----- | ------ | -------- | ------------- |\n| `id`  | string | yes      | The run's id. |","table":"table-1"},"5175":{"id":"/docs/api/2026-09-14/workflows-runs-get-10","page_id":"/docs/api/2026-09-14/workflows-runs-get","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/api/2026-09-14/workflows-runs-get#response-200","content":"| Field    | Type                                                                                                                                                   | Required | Description                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                        |\n| -------- | ------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------ | -------- | ------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------ |\n| `origin` | one of `ask`, `slack`, `teams`, `ticket`, `ticket_event`, `event`, `mcp`, `editor`, `parent_workflow`, `schedule`, `api`, `other`, `unknown` or string | yes      | Where it was started from, such as `slack`, `schedule` or `api`. `ticket_event` is an event on a ticket, `event` an event in your organization's data, `editor` a test from the workflow editor and `parent_workflow` another workflow. `other` is a place not listed here, and `unknown` means none was recorded. |","table":"table-1"},"5176":{"id":"/docs/api/2026-09-14/workflows-runs-get-11","page_id":"/docs/api/2026-09-14/workflows-runs-get","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/api/2026-09-14/workflows-runs-get#response-200","content":"| Field              | Type           | Required | Description                                          |\n| ------------------ | -------------- | -------- | ---------------------------------------------------- |\n| `pending_requests` | list of object | yes      | The approvals, tasks and forms it is waiting on now. |","table":"table-1"},"5177":{"id":"/docs/api/2026-09-14/workflows-runs-get-12","page_id":"/docs/api/2026-09-14/workflows-runs-get","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/api/2026-09-14/workflows-runs-get#response-200","content":"| Field                        | Type    | Required | Description                                                  |\n| ---------------------------- | ------- | -------- | ------------------------------------------------------------ |\n| `pending_requests_truncated` | boolean | yes      | Whether there are more pending requests than the list shows. |","table":"table-1"},"5178":{"id":"/docs/api/2026-09-14/workflows-runs-get-13","page_id":"/docs/api/2026-09-14/workflows-runs-get","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/api/2026-09-14/workflows-runs-get#response-200","content":"| Field   | Type                                               | Required | Description                                                                                                                                                                         |\n| ------- | -------------------------------------------------- | -------- | ----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------- |\n| `phase` | one of `pending`, `running`, `waiting`, `terminal` | yes      | `pending` when it has not started yet, `running` or `waiting` while it is under way, and `terminal` once it has ended. `waiting` means it is held for a person or an outside event. |","table":"table-1"},"5179":{"id":"/docs/api/2026-09-14/workflows-runs-get-14","page_id":"/docs/api/2026-09-14/workflows-runs-get","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/api/2026-09-14/workflows-runs-get#response-200","content":"| Field      | Type            | Required | Description                                                           |\n| ---------- | --------------- | -------- | --------------------------------------------------------------------- |\n| `recovery` | object, or null | yes      | What can be done about the failure. `null` when nothing is suggested. |","table":"table-1"},"5180":{"id":"/docs/api/2026-09-14/workflows-runs-get-15","page_id":"/docs/api/2026-09-14/workflows-runs-get","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/api/2026-09-14/workflows-runs-get#response-200","content":"| Field    | Type            | Required | Description                                                                     |\n| -------- | --------------- | -------- | ------------------------------------------------------------------------------- |\n| `result` | object, or null | yes      | How it ended. `null` until it has ended, or when how it ended was not recorded. |","table":"table-1"},"5181":{"id":"/docs/api/2026-09-14/workflows-runs-get-16","page_id":"/docs/api/2026-09-14/workflows-runs-get","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/api/2026-09-14/workflows-runs-get#response-200","content":"| Field        | Type                        | Required | Description                                                             |\n| ------------ | --------------------------- | -------- | ----------------------------------------------------------------------- |\n| `started_at` | string (date-time), or null | yes      | When it started. `null` for runs that started before this was recorded. |","table":"table-1"},"5182":{"id":"/docs/api/2026-09-14/workflows-runs-get-17","page_id":"/docs/api/2026-09-14/workflows-runs-get","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/api/2026-09-14/workflows-runs-get#response-200","content":"| Field  | Type            | Required | Description                                                                   |\n| ------ | --------------- | -------- | ----------------------------------------------------------------------------- |\n| `step` | string, or null | yes      | The step it is on. `null` when it is not on one, as for a run that has ended. |","table":"table-1"},"5183":{"id":"/docs/api/2026-09-14/workflows-runs-get-18","page_id":"/docs/api/2026-09-14/workflows-