AUTHENTICATED` | 401         | You are not signed in, or your token has expired. Sign in again. |","table":"table-8"},"5219":{"id":"/docs/api/2026-09-14/workflows-runs-get-54","page_id":"/docs/api/2026-09-14/workflows-runs-get","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/api/2026-09-14/workflows-runs-get#errors","content":"| Code          | HTTP status | Meaning                                                  |\n| ------------- | ----------- | -------------------------------------------------------- |\n| `UNAVAILABLE` | 503         | The service is temporarily unavailable. Try again later. |","table":"table-8"},"5220":{"id":"/docs/api/2026-09-14/workflows-runs-get-55","page_id":"/docs/api/2026-09-14/workflows-runs-get","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/api/2026-09-14/workflows-runs-get#errors","content":"| Code                | HTTP status | Meaning                                                                              |\n| ------------------- | ----------- | ------------------------------------------------------------------------------------ |\n| `VALIDATION_FAILED` | 422         | Part of the request is not valid. Correct what the response names and send it again. |","table":"table-8"},"5221":{"id":"/docs/api/2026-09-14/workflows-runs-get-56","page_id":"/docs/api/2026-09-14/workflows-runs-get","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/api/2026-09-14/workflows-runs-get#errors","content":"| Code              | HTTP status | Meaning                                                                                         |\n| ----------------- | ----------- | ----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------- |\n| `VERSION_UNKNOWN` | 400         | This API does not serve the version you asked for. Send one of the dates in published_versions. |","table":"table-8"},"5222":{"id":"/docs/api/2026-09-14/workflows-runs-list","page_id":"/docs/api/2026-09-14/workflows-runs-list","type":"page","content":"List runs","breadcrumbs":["Docs","API reference","2026-09-14","Runs"],"tags":[],"url":"/docs/api/2026-09-14/workflows-runs-list"},"5223":{"id":"/docs/api/2026-09-14/workflows-runs-list-0","page_id":"/docs/api/2026-09-14/workflows-runs-list","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/api/2026-09-14/workflows-runs-list","content":"GET /runs"},"5224":{"id":"/docs/api/2026-09-14/workflows-runs-list-1","page_id":"/docs/api/2026-09-14/workflows-runs-list","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/api/2026-09-14/workflows-runs-list#parameters","content":"Parameters"},"5225":{"id":"/docs/api/2026-09-14/workflows-runs-list-2","page_id":"/docs/api/2026-09-14/workflows-runs-list","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/api/2026-09-14/workflows-runs-list#response-200","content":"Response 200"},"5226":{"id":"/docs/api/2026-09-14/workflows-runs-list-3","page_id":"/docs/api/2026-09-14/workflows-runs-list","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/api/2026-09-14/workflows-runs-list#errors","content":"Errors"},"5227":{"id":"/docs/api/2026-09-14/workflows-runs-list-4","page_id":"/docs/api/2026-09-14/workflows-runs-list","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/api/2026-09-14/workflows-runs-list","content":"Runs you started and runs of workflows you can edit or publish, newest first, paged with a cursor. Send the same filters with every cursor. Each says whether it is running, waiting on a person or finished, and how it ended. A run you can see only through its ticket is not listed, but you can read it by its id. Runs of a single action are not listed. A list reaches back at most 10,000 runs, so narrow it with `started_since` to go further. Whether a run is waiting is read live, so a run that is waiting can show as running when that could not be read."},"5228":{"id":"/docs/api/2026-09-14/workflows-runs-list-5","page_id":"/docs/api/2026-09-14/workflows-runs-list","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/api/2026-09-14/workflows-runs-list#parameters","content":"| Name      | In    | Type                                                 