                                                                                                                                                                                               |\n| ------ | ----- | ----------------------------------------------------- | -------- | ------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------- |\n| `lens` | query | one of `to_decide`, `requested_by_me`, `involving_me` |          | `to_decide` is approvals waiting on you, `requested_by_me` is ones you asked for or that were raised on your behalf, and `involving_me` is both, and any you took part in. These cover tasks to complete and forms to fill in as well as approvals. With `to_decide`, a `status` other than `pending` returns everything you took part in. Defaults to `to_decide`. |","table":"table-0"},"6902":{"id":"/docs/api/latest/approvals-list-7","page_id":"/docs/api/latest/approvals-list","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/api/latest/approvals-list#parameters","content":"| Name    | In    | Type    | Required | Description                                    |\n| ------- | ----- | ------- | -------- | ---------------------------------------------- |\n| `limit` | query | integer |          | How many to return, up to 100. Defaults to 50. |","table":"table-0"},"6903":{"id":"/docs/api/latest/approvals-list-8","page_id":"/docs/api/latest/approvals-list","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/api/latest/approvals-list#parameters","content":"| Name     | In    | Type                                                                                       | Required | Description                                                                                                               