y match than came back. There is no next page; narrow the request with `status` or `lens`. The service filters after it applies the limit, so a short page is usually the whole list, but an approval that has more than one step can make it look shorter than it is. |","table":"table-1"},"6905":{"id":"/docs/api/latest/approvals-list-10","page_id":"/docs/api/latest/approvals-list","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/api/latest/approvals-list#response-200","content":"| Field   | Type           | Required | Description                             |\n| ------- | -------------- | -------- | --------------------------------------- |\n| `items` | list of object | yes      | One page of approvals, tasks and forms. |","table":"table-1"},"6906":{"id":"/docs/api/latest/approvals-list-11","page_id":"/docs/api/latest/approvals-list","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/api/latest/approvals-list#response-200","content":"An approval in a list."},"6907":{"id":"/docs/api/latest/approvals-list-12","page_id":"/docs/api/latest/approvals-list","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/api/latest/approvals-list#response-200","content":"| Field        | Type    | Required | Description                               |\n| ------------ | ------- | -------- | ----------------------------------------- |\n| `can_decide` | boolean | yes      | Whether you can approve or reject it now. |","table":"table-2"},"6908":{"id":"/docs/api/latest/approvals-list-13","page_id":"/docs/api/latest/approvals-list","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/api/latest/approvals-list#response-200","content":"| Field        | Type                        | Required | Description                   |\n| ------------ | --------------------------- | -------- | ----------------------------- |\n| `created_at` | string (date-time), or null | yes      | When the approval was raised. |","table":"table-2"},"6909":{"id":"/docs/api/latest/approvals-list-14","page_id":"/docs/api/latest/approvals-list","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/api