mation. The knowledge service verifies uploader ownership and file eligibility and preserves conversation provenance. A duplicate points to the existing document without changing its type or who gets answers from it. Up to 50 MiB. Saved does not mean searchable: inspect processing and the document status, then get the document to follow completion."},"8074":{"id":"/docs/api/latest/knowledge-documents-upload-5","page_id":"/docs/api/latest/knowledge-documents-upload","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/api/latest/knowledge-documents-upload#request-body","content":"| Field      | Type                        | Required | Description                            |\n| ---------- | --------------------------- | -------- | -------------------------------------- |\n| `doc_type` | one of `general`, `runbook` | yes      | Choose general knowledge or a runbook. |","table":"table-0"},"8075":{"id":"/docs/api/latest/knowledge-documents-upload-6","page_id":"/docs/api/latest/knowledge-documents-upload","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/api/latest/knowledge-documents-upload#request-body","content":"| Field     | Type   | Required | Description                                                                                                                                       |\n| --------- | ------ | -------- | ------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------- |\n| `file_id` | string | yes      | The file ID returned by your upload or authorized attachment lookup. Use a ready file you uploaded, at most 50 MiB; do not supply a download URL. |","table":"table-0"},"8076":{"id":"/docs/api/latest/knowledge-documents-upload-7","page_id":"/docs/api/latest/knowledge-documents-upload","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/api/latest/knowledge-documents-upload#request-body","content":"| Field        | Type                            | Required | Description                                                                                                                                     |\n| ------------ | ------------------------------- | -------- | ----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------- |\n| `visibility` | one of `end_user`, `privileged` |          | end_user saves it for Everyone, privileged for people who can read all privileged documents. Send `who_gets_answers` or `visibility`, not both. |","table":"table-0"},"8077":{"id":"/docs/api/latest/knowledge-documents-upload-8","page_id":"/docs/api/latest/knowledge-documents-upload","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/api/latest/knowledge-documents-upload#request-body","content":"| Field              | Type           | Required | Description                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                            |\n| ------------------ | -------------- | -------- | -------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------- |\n| `who_gets_answers` | list of object |          | Who gets answers from the document: groups and people by id, or `anyone` for Everyone. People who can read all privileged documents always get answers too. An empty list leaves only them. Confirm who gets answers before saving. Send `who_gets_answers` or `visibility`, not both. |","table":"table-0"},"8078":{"id":"/docs/api/latest/knowledge-documents-upload-9","page_id":"/docs/api/latest/knowledge-documents-upload","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/api/latest/knowledge-documents-upload#request-body","content":"A group, a person, or Everyone, as one entry of who gets answers from a document."},"8079":{"id":"/docs/api/latest/knowledge-documents-upload-10","page_id":"/docs/api/latest/knowledge-documents-upload","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/api/latest/knowledge-documents-upload#request-body","content":"| Field | Type            | Required | Description                                            |\n| ----- | --------------- | -------- | ------------------------------------------------------ |\n| `id`  | string, or null |          | The group's or person's id. Leave it out for `anyone`. |","table":"table-1"},"8080":{"id":"/docs/api/latest/knowledge-documents-upload-11","page_id":"/docs/api/latest/knowledge-documents-upload","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/api/latest/knowledge-documents-upload#request-body","content":"| Field  | Type                               | Required | Description                                                                                                                                                                                     |\n| ------ | ---------------------------------- | -------- | ----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------- |\n| `kind` | one of `group`, `person`, `anyone` | yes      | `group` for a group, `person` for one person, or `anyone` for Everyone, which answers wherever someone asks, Slack, Teams and ticket replies included. The Everyone group is saved as `anyone`. |","table":"table-1"},"8081":{"id":"/docs/api/latest/knowledge-documents-upload-12","page_id":"/docs/api/latest/knowledge-documents-upload","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/api/latest/knowledge-documents-upload#response-201","content":"| Field      | Type   | Required | Description                         |\n| ---------- | ------ | -------- | ----------------------------------- |\n| `document` | object | yes      | The d