 clear a field, set a state or post a comment. Send the same idempotency key when retrying. A retry can repeat the change and overwrite an edit made between the two attempts."},"8950":{"id":"/docs/api/latest/tickets-bulk-update-5","page_id":"/docs/api/latest/tickets-bulk-update","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/api/latest/tickets-bulk-update#request-body","content":"What changing many tickets at once accepts. Every ticket gets the same change: at least one\nof priority, assignee or queue. A field can't be cleared here; omit it to leave it alone."},"8951":{"id":"/docs/api/latest/tickets-bulk-update-6","page_id":"/docs/api/latest/tickets-bulk-update","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/api/latest/tickets-bulk-update#request-body","content":"| Field      | Type   | Required | Description                                                                     |\n| ---------- | ------ | -------- | ------------------------------------------------------------------------------- |\n| `assignee` | string |          | Hand every ticket to this person: `me` for yourself, or the person's stable id. |","table":"table-0"},"8952":{"id":"/docs/api/latest/tickets-bulk-update-7","page_id":"/docs/api/latest/tickets-bulk-update","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/api/latest/tickets-bulk-update#request-body","content":"| Field      | Type   | Required | Description          |\n| ---------- | ------ | -------- | -------------------- |\n| `priority` | string |          | Change the priority. |","table":"table-0"},"8953":{"id":"/docs/api/latest/tickets-bulk-update-8","page_id":"/docs/api/latest/tickets-bulk-update","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/api/latest/tickets-bulk-update#request-body","content":"| Field   | Type          | Required | Description                      |\n| ------- | ------------- | -------- | -------------------------------- |\n| `queue` | string (uuid) |          | Move every ticket to this queue. |","table":"table-0"},"8954":{"id":"/docs/api/latest/tickets-bu