ocs/api/latest/tickets-followers-remove-15","page_id":"/docs/api/latest/tickets-followers-remove","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/api/latest/tickets-followers-remove#response-200","content":"| Field  | Type            | Required | Description                                                                                                                        |\n| ------ | --------------- | -------- | ---------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------- |\n| `hold` | object, or null |          | Who has the ticket while it is on hold, when reminders to them start and after how much quiet. Empty unless the ticket is on hold. |","table":"table-2"},"9447":{"id":"/docs/api/latest/tickets-followers-remove-16","page_id":"/docs/api/latest/tickets-followers-remove","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/api/latest/tickets-followers-remove#response-200","content":"| Field | Type   | Required | Description                              |\n| ----- | ------ | -------- | ---------------------------------------- |\n| `id`  | string | yes      | The ticket id people see in the product. |","table":"table-2"},"9448":{"id":"/docs/api/latest/tickets-followers-remove-17","page_id":"/docs/api/latest/tickets-followers-remove","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/api/latest/tickets-followers-remove#response-200","content":"| Field      | Type            | Required | Description                     |\n| ---------- | --------------- | -------- | ------------------------------- |\n| `priority` | string, or null |          | Slug of this ticket's priority. |","table":"table-2"},"9449":{"id":"/docs/api/latest/tickets-followers-remove-18","page_id":"/docs/api/latest/tickets-followers-remove","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/api/latest/tickets-followers-remove#response-200","content":"| Field   | Type                   | Required | Description                                  |\n| ------- | ----------------------