- | ------ | -------- | ---------------------------------------------- |\n| `workflow` | path | string | yes      | The workflow's id, from the list of workflows. |","table":"table-0"},"10162":{"id":"/docs/api/latest/workflows-dependencies-list-6","page_id":"/docs/api/latest/workflows-dependencies-list","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/api/latest/workflows-dependencies-list#parameters","content":"| Name      | In    | Type   | Required | Description                                                  |\n| --------- | ----- | ------ | -------- | ------------------------------------------------------------ |\n| `version` | query | string |          | The version to read. Leave it out for the published version. |","table":"table-0"},"10163":{"id":"/docs/api/latest/workflows-dependencies-list-7","page_id":"/docs/api/latest/workflows-dependencies-list","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/api/latest/workflows-dependencies-list#response-200","content":"| Field       | Type           | Required | Description                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                       |\n| ----------- | -------------- | -------- | ------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------- |\n| `called_by` | list of object | yes      | Workflows that call this one, from their published versions, once for each version of this workflow they ask for. The first 100 calls to this workflow are read, and a workflow that calls it from two steps counts twice, so fewer callers may be listed. Only workflows you can see are listed. |","table":"table-1"},"10164":{"id":"/docs/api/latest/workflows-dependencies-list-8","page_id":"/docs/api/latest/workflows-dependencies-list","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/api/latest/workflows-dependencies-list#response-200","content":"| Field              | Type    | Required | Description                                                                                                                                                                                                             |\n| ------------------ | ------- | -------- | ----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------- |\n| `callers_complete` | boolean | yes      | `false` when more callers you can see exist than are listed, or when some workflow's calls could not be read. A caller you cannot see is never listed, whatever this says, and deleting the workflow also turns it off. |","table":"table-1"},"10165":{"id":"/docs/api/latest/workflows-dependencies-list-9","page_id":"/docs/api/latest/workflows-dependencies-list","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/api/latest/workflows-dependencies-list#response-200","content":"| Field   | Type           | Required | Description                                                                                                                                                                            |\n| ------- | -------------- | -------- | -------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------- |\n| `calls` | list of object | yes      | The workflows this version calls, once for each version of a workflow it asks for. A workflow that was deleted, or that you cannot see, is not listed, whatever `calls_complete` says. |","table":"table-1"},"10166":{"id":"/docs/api/latest/workflows-dependencies-list-1