"text","url":"/docs/api/latest/workflows-grants-add","content":"Giving someone access to a workflow changes what they can do with it straight away. It does not tell them. Giving access that someone already has, whoever gave it, changes nothing and sends nothing. A group can be given view or run, and everyone in your organization only run, and the person must be in your organization. Anyone who can change who has access to a workflow can give themselves any access to it. For people who manage this workflow's access."},"10308":{"id":"/docs/api/latest/workflows-grants-add-5","page_id":"/docs/api/latest/workflows-grants-add","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/api/latest/workflows-grants-add#parameters","content":"| Name       | In   | Type   | Required | Description                                    |\n| ---------- | ---- | ------ | -------- | ---------------------------------------------- |\n| `workflow` | path | string | yes      | The workflow's id, from the list of workflows. |","table":"table-0"},"10309":{"id":"/docs/api/latest/workflows-grants-add-6","page_id":"/docs/api/latest/workflows-grants-add","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/api/latest/workflows-grants-add#parameters","content":"| Name           | In   | Type   | Required | Description                                                               |\n| -------------- | ---- | ------ | -------- | ------------------------------------------------------------------------- |\n| `grantee_type` | path | string | yes      | `person` or `group`. Everyone in your organization is the group Everyone. |","table":"table-0"},"10310":{"id":"/docs/api/latest/workflows-grants-add-7","page_id":"/docs/api/latest/workflows-grants-add","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/api/latest/workflows-grants-add#parameters","content":"| Name      | In   | Type   | Required | Description                                                 |\n| --------- | ---- | ------ | -------- | ----------------------------------------------------------- |\n| `grantee` | path | string | yes      | The person's id, or the group's id from the list of groups. |","table":"table-0"},"10311":{"id":"/docs/api/latest/workflows-grants-add-8","page_id":"/docs/api/latest/workflows-grants-add","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/api/latest/workflows-grants-add#parameters","content":"| Name         | In   | Type   | Required | Description                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                           |\n| ------------ | ---- | ------ | -------- | ------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------- |\n| `permission` | path | string | yes      | `view` lets them see the workflow and its versions. `run` lets them start it. `edit` lets them change its draft. `publish` lets them publish versions, turn it on and off, delete it and change who has access. `self_service_run` lets them start it when it is offered to everyone. |","table":"table-0"},"10312":{"id":"/docs/api/latest/workflows-grants-add-9","page_id":"/docs/api/latest/workflows-grants-add","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/api/latest/workflows-grants-add#response-200","content":"| Field     | Type   | Required | Description         |\n| --------- | ------ | -------- | ------------------- |\n| `grantee` | object | yes      | Who a grant is for. |","table":"table-1"},"10313":{"id":"/docs/api/latest/workflows-grants-add-10","page_id":"/docs/api/latest/workflows-grants-add","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/api/latest/workflows-grants-add#response-200","content":"| Field  | Type    | Required | Description                                           