est/workflows-grants-remove","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/api/latest/workflows-grants-remove","content":"Take away one kind of access to this workflow. It changes what they can do with it straight away. Taking away access someone does not have changes nothing. Access that was given somewhere else, or that everyone has because the workflow is offered to everyone, is not taken away here: you are told, and nothing changes. The list of access says who gave each one. If someone else also gave the access, `held` stays `true` after you take away yours. Access that covers every workflow in your organization is not touched by this. Anyone who can change who has access to a workflow can take away their own, and taking away your own publish access can leave you unable to change it again. For people who manage this workflow's access."},"10401":{"id":"/docs/api/latest/workflows-grants-remove-5","page_id":"/docs/api/latest/workflows-grants-remove","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/api/latest/workflows-grants-remove#parameters","content":"| Name       | In   | Type   | Required | Description                                    |\n| ---------- | ---- | ------ | -------- | ---------------------------------------------- |\n| `workflow` | path | string | yes      | The workflow's id, from the list of workflows. |","table":"table-0"},"10402":{"id":"/docs/api/latest/workflows-grants-remove-6","page_id":"/docs/api/latest/workflows-grants-remove","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/api/latest/workflows-grants-remove#parameters","content":"| Name           | In   | Type   | Required | Description                                                               |\n| -------------- | ---- | ------ | -------- | ------------------------------------------------------------------------- |\n| `grantee_type` | path | string | yes      | `person` or `group`. Everyone in your organization is the group Everyone. |","table":"table-0"},"10403":{"id":"/docs/api/latest/workflows-grants-remove-7","page_id":"/docs/api/latest/workflows-grants-remove","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/api/latest/workflows-grants-remove#parameters","content":"| Name      | In   | Type   | Required | Description                                                 |\n| --------- | ---- | ------ | -------- | ----------------------------------------------------------- |\n| `grantee` | path | string | yes      | The person's id, or the group's id from the list of groups. |","table":"table-0"},"10404":{"id":"/docs/api/latest/workflows-grants-remove-8","page_id":"/docs/api/latest/workflows-grants-remove","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/api/latest/workflows-grants-remove#parameters","content":"| Name         | In   | Type   | Required | Description                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                           |\n| ------------ | ---- | ------ | -------- | ------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------- |\n| `permission` | path | string | yes      | `view` lets them see the workflow and its versions. `run` lets them start it. `edit` lets them change its draft. `publish` lets them publish versions, turn it on and off, delete it and change who has access. `self_service_run` lets them start it when it is offered to everyone. |","table":"table-0"},"10405":{"id":"/docs/api/latest/workflows-grants-remove-9","page_id":"/docs/api/latest/workflows-grants-remove","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/api/latest/workflows-grants-remove#response-200","content":"| Field     | Type   | Required | Description         |\n| --------- | ------ | -------- | ------------------- |\n| `grantee` | object | yes      | Who a grant is for. |","table":"table-1"},"10406":{"id":"/docs/api/latest/workflows-grants-remove-10","page_id":"/docs/api/latest/workflows-grants-remove","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/api/latest/workflows-grants-remove#response-200","content":"| Field  | Type    | Required | Description                                                                                                                                                                                               |\n| ------ | ------- | -------- | --------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------- |\n| `held` | boolean | yes      | Whether the person or group has this access on this workflow after the change. It is `true` after giving it. After taking it away it is `false`, unless someone else also gave it, and then it is `true`. |","table":"table-1"},"10407":{"id":"/docs/api/latest/workflows-grants-remove-11","page_id":"/docs/api/latest/workflows-grants-remove","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/api/latest/workflows-grants-remove#response-200","content":"| Field        | Type                                                                  | Required | Description                              |\n| ------------ | --------------------------------------------------------------------- | -------- | ---------------------------------------- |\n| `permission` | one of `view`, `run`, `edit`, `publish`, `self_service_run` or string | yes      | The access that was given or taken away. |","table":"table-1"},"10408":{"id":"/docs/api/latest/workflows-grants-remove-12","page_id":"/docs/api/latest/workflows-grants-remove","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/api/latest/workflows-grants-remove#response-200","content":"Who a grant is for."},"10409":{"id":"/docs/api/latest/workflows-grants-remove-13","page_id":"/docs/api/latest/