s-get","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/api/latest/workflows-inputs-get","content":"What a run of the published version asks for, with what is already known for you: the value the service would fill in, the values it suggests and the only values an input takes. Use it to see which inputs you still have to give before you start a run. A workflow you cannot see is reported as not found, and one you can see but may not start is refused."},"10437":{"id":"/docs/api/latest/workflows-inputs-get-5","page_id":"/docs/api/latest/workflows-inputs-get","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/api/latest/workflows-inputs-get#parameters","content":"| Name       | In   | Type   | Required | Description                                    |\n| ---------- | ---- | ------ | -------- | ---------------------------------------------- |\n| `workflow` | path | string | yes      | The workflow's id, from the list of workflows. |","table":"table-0"},"10438":{"id":"/docs/api/latest/workflows-inputs-get-6","page_id":"/docs/api/latest/workflows-inputs-get","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/api/latest/workflows-inputs-get#response-200","content":"| Field    | Type           | Required | Description                                 |\n| -------- | -------------- | -------- | ------------------------------------------- |\n| `inputs` | list of object | yes      | Each input, in the order the workflow asks. |","table":"table-1"},"10439":{"id":"/docs/api/latest/workflows-inputs-get-7","page_id":"/docs/api/latest/workflows-inputs-get","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/api/latest/workflows-inputs-get#response-200","content":"| Field   | Type                                                                  | Required | Description                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                |\n| ------- | ---