Did you mean 'stlabs tickets list'?` |"],[10912,"| You see                 | Why                                                                                            | What to do                                 |\n| ----------------------- | ---------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------- | ------------------------------------------ |\n| `stlabs: not signed in` | You have no saved session, and `STLABS_TOKEN` is not set. `stlabs` sends nothing. Exit code 1. | Run `stlabs login`, or set `STLABS_TOKEN`. |"],[10838,"| You send                                                                     | You get                                        |\n| ---------------------------------------------------------------------------- | ---------------------------------------------- |\n| The same key while the first attempt is unfinished or its outcome is unknown | A refusal that says to wait or to check first. |"],[10839,"| You send                          | You get                                             |\n| --------------------------------- | --------------------------------------------------- |\n| The same key and a different body | A refusal with the code `IDEMPOTENCY_KEY_MISMATCH`. |"],[10837,"| You send                       | You get                                                                                                  |\n| ------------------------------ | -------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------- |\n| The same key and the same body | The original response, with the same `id` and status and the header `Idempotent-Replayed` set to `true`. |"],[10900,"| You want                                    | Write               |\n| ------------------------------------------- | ------------------- |\n| An assignee of `@me`, which starts with `@` | `'assignee: \"@me\"'` |"],[10899,"| You want                      | Write             |\n| --------------------